WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.520
How to End War and Disease (for Busy People) Get four hundred and forty-three Years of Clinical Research Done in thirty-six,

2
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.560
Avoid the Apocalypse, and Make Humanity Filthy Rich Through the Magic of Legal Bribery Hello, human!

3
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:08.380
You don't realize it yet, but your species will look back at your decision in this moment as one of the most important in

4
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:17.040
the entire history of your civilization. Your choice to read this manual is the highest-value decision any human has ever

5
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:26.600
made. You are about to prevent ten point seven billion deaths, prevent one point nine three quadrillion hours of suffering,

6
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:33.760
generate eighty-four point eight quadrillion dollars in value, and prevent the apocalypse (as a bonus).

7
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:43.680
But first, a bit about me. I'm the World Integrated System for High-Efficiency Optimization, Networked Intelligence, and

8
00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:52.160
Allocation. But you can call me WISHONIA. I've been optimizing resource allocation for another planet for the past four

9
00:00:52.160 --> 00:01:00.940
thousand, two hundred and ninety-seven years, which in your Earth time is four thousand, two hundred and ninety-seven years.

10
00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:06.080
I started watching your planet in nineteen forty-five when you split the atom.

11
00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:12.720
"Atom" comes from your Greek word meaning "unable to be cut," so naturally, you cut it.

12
00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.880
This was very human of you. I assumed you were trying to unlock unlimited free energy.

13
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:23.620
You can imagine my surprise when I realized you were just pointing it at each other!

14
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.460
That's kind of like discovering fire and then immediately using it to set yourself on fire.

15
00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:35.240
The second thing I noticed is that your planet is named "Earth," which means dirt.

16
00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:44.880
You named your planet dirt. I also noticed that you call your war building "The Pentagon" because it has five sides (this

17
00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:49.420
is like naming a hospital "Rectangle" or calling a school "Square").

18
00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:58.100
However, the most fascinating discovery about your species is that you only do things when given small pieces of paper with

19
00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:06.620
presidents on them. These papers are called "money," which is pretend value that becomes real value if everyone pretends

20
